Subject: Rules search counts and annotate heading said more than they meant

Found in the assistant tool review of the live gateway (2026-10-28):

- rules_search said "283 CR entries mention these terms" for "commander
  damage", but an entry counts when it has any one of the terms. With two
  or more terms it now says "mention at least one of these terms" (one term:
  "mention this term").
- goldfish_annotate's Out of scope section said "Not cast in the sim (their
  whole effect is one of these)", while each card's own line (and
  goldfish_run's honesty report) says permanents are cast for the rest of
  their text: a commander listed there read as never cast. The heading now
  says spells among them are not cast and permanents are.

tests/test_research_wording_2.py; tests/test_rules_tools.py asserts the new
single-term wording.

Upstream: Kautiontape/mystic-forge at dd82cd1 has none of these. Needs
patches 0001-0014 applied first.

